                                                "example_id": "3ec6e1c7-7482-4d14-9833-eaa528393ff7",
                                                "sense_id": "10676f7f-d3fd-3c5a-8ca2-e83eb238fc15",
                                                "text": "The information charges that the said Flem Parker, on or about the 20th day of November, 1890, and before the filing of this information, at the county and state aforesaid, did willfully, unlawfully, and feloniously enter a certain barn […]"
